== Overview ==
The L'''arge Glasses Toilet''' is a larger variant of the [[Glass Toilet|Glasses Toilet]] and has more health then the normal variant. The toilet is grey and has a regular variant. It does 150 damage to the base.

== Appearance ==
It has a large gray toilet with black gloss glasses.

== Waves ==
Endless: Wave 10 as Boss
== Health ==
Health: 9000
== Strategy ==

* This enemy is very easy to defeat, but do not use any TV Units that ONLY use their screen to attack.

== Trivia ==

*This toilet can be affected by [[Large TV Man]] and the normal one if used in the start of the map.
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Semi-Large_Gray_Sunglasses_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Semi-Large Gray Sunglasses Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
*It is the first boss of [[Endless Mode]] on Wave 5

